# Atlas — countries & client orgs (Sprint 01)
# Run against: dotnet run --project src/Atlas.Api  (defaults to http://localhost:5000)
# VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client compatible.

@host = http://localhost:5000

### List countries (seeded reference data)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/countries

### Get one country (codes are case-insensitive)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/countries/deu

### Unknown country → 404 problem+json
GET {{host}}/api/v1/countries/FRA

### Malformed country code → 422 problem+json (domain-rule-violated)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/countries/FRANCE

### Create a client org → 201 + Location
POST {{host}}/api/v1/client-orgs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Initech GmbH"
}

### Blank name → 422 problem+json
POST {{host}}/api/v1/client-orgs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "   "
}

### List client orgs (newest first, cursor pagination)
# Follow the X-Next-Cursor RESPONSE HEADER for the next page.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/client-orgs?limit=2

### Next page (paste the X-Next-Cursor value)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/client-orgs?limit=2&cursor=PASTE_CURSOR_HERE

### Out-of-range limit → 400 problem+json (rejected, not clamped)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/client-orgs?limit=0

### The OpenAPI document (drift-gated in CI)
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
